/*
  PDFRender - Photoshop PSD decoding.  See h/pdfpsd.

  Written from the published PSD file-format specification.  The file
  is a fixed header, then four length-prefixed sections - colour mode
  data, image resources, layer information - and then the composite
  image, which is stored a channel at a time rather than a pixel at a
  time.

